| Sustained practical, advanced, and independent studies | [Complete the substantial book, course, and laboratory programme](research/A-sustained-geology-course-and-laboratory-study.lingua#r_36X2B2GGAC1WH16DR834M974J0) · [Carry out a sustained mapping study from question to revised geological model](research/Independent-mapping-and-field-evidence-study.lingua#r_5ZC4N7CSG8RZF5ZT177EHCFQYR) · [Reconstruct a numerical geological history with analytical and model uncertainty](research/Advanced-geochronology-and-event-history.lingua#r_4WC3HDHSNQKQ941M1S0VY8HJR3) · [Test a regional reconstruction against geometry, ages, and competing models](research/Advanced-structural-and-plate-reconstruction.lingua#r_0TZDDE53WP7NTCMNE0D5VB4EMC) · [Follow a geological material and its water/ground dependencies into infrastructure](research/Geology-in-a-material-and-infrastructure-chain.lingua#r_0B6Z481YETERS1TN848T6JRVN0) · [Develop and defend an independent geological investigation](research/Independent-geological-scholarship.lingua#r_3HWJT4PS3ZAP0SY5968CMBK6ST) · [Demonstrate integrated geological understanding and continue into specialist work](research/Geology-completion-and-continuations.lingua#r_0MHXG3169B8906QN4KB9XF9QH5) |

Five shared learning Records keep their own routes and have distinct geology continuations: [Read graphs, interpolate, and question a visual claim](../../../inquiry/quantitative-literacy/foundations/Graphs-and-interpolation.lingua#r_2GDCZSQKNW5BCGN7B5D9G36HK2), [Connect crystal structure, defects, and composition with material properties](../../../stem/chemistry/general-chemistry/states/Crystals-disorder-and-material-properties.lingua#r_2D2PGMBBES807ABNV8V0A46JZA), [A specimen, a sampling target, and a result about a population](../../../inquiry/metrology/foundations/Sampling-and-representativeness.lingua#r_0F0VEC42GPQPRZM0S7MXF7GAEH), [Distinguish nuclear change from ordinary chemical transformation](../../../stem/chemistry/general-chemistry/descriptive/Nuclides-decay-and-nuclear-change.lingua#r_0Y7ZKCD61XN1RHC4HKMBDZPK35), and [Build a numerical validation argument across several kinds of evidence](../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/numerics/A-numerical-validation-study.lingua#r_7EY9S6DXHFHSJAGA30W35A4ZD8). Select both endpoints of `#geology` learning assertions to follow this subject; source references, regional context, and other predicates keep their own meaning. A Protein can use that ordinary selection without an extra Trail feature or stored view.

[Geology sources — complete books, field methods, maps, and research](Sources.lingua#r_3H47FYGCEYFZPW2VK77PMR0ECB) identifies editions, authorized access, licence distinctions, and access limits. Books, articles, maps, course media, and datasets remain external references. The inline plane calculation and connecting explanations are original teaching material.

[Demonstrate integrated geological understanding and continue into specialist work](research/Geology-completion-and-continuations.lingua#r_0MHXG3169B8906QN4KB9XF9QH5) explains the substantial reading, practical evidence, independent calculations, and scholarly work expected at the later stages. A document-based interpretation is valuable but does not by itself demonstrate field or instrument competence. No automatic completion claim is made for a reader.

Continue through [Earth — materials, processes, and geological history](../Earth.lingua#r_5H7Y6QD1FW4Z0JJ6C7SH4DDHXH) and [Nature — Earth, living systems, and their relationships](../../Nature.lingua#r_5DAMNRQZX9M2PRPHVJB673XX21) for the wider natural world, [STEM — mathematics, science, and engineering](../../../stem/STEM.lingua#r_4B137J3ZBVM7TD2NA797H2CZ7E) and [Inquiry — shared ways to understand and investigate](../../../inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB) for shared methods, and [Ergon](../../../ergon/Ergon.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001) for extraction, material production, operation, and maintenance. Questions about evidence and explanation return to [Philosophy](../../../philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001). Deeper mineralogy/petrology, geochemistry, geophysics, hydrology, mining, and engineering studies retain their unique work rather than repeating this foundation.

**Continue:** [Begin geology with sustained reading and a gradual practical progression](foundations/Reading-geology-from-zero.lingua#r_3H533XF25V4VZX2GZ149Q8M6KQ).
} r_3CK43VQS79NK0STWNPSCS8YM06

Extension @geology "lince.vocabulary" {
 definitions {
  geology "A useful continuation through Earth materials, processes, histories, field evidence, quantitative interpretation, and geological research. Other learning selections and source references keep their own predicates."
 }
}
